1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,590
I'm the only one
who will love you forever.

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:04,590
You know that too, don't you?

3
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:11,520
I don't know if
he'll stay with me forever.

4
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:13,100
Even if he

5
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:16,350
chooses to leave me one day,
I won't blame him.

6
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:20,110
Because I love him.

7
00:00:21,990 --> 00:00:23,240
Taeseok,

8
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:25,320
if you really love me,

9
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:28,740
you should let me go.

10
00:00:30,330 --> 00:00:32,910
I don't want you to
ruin who you are for my sake.

11
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:35,080
You're a good person.

12
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:38,540
I got it.

13
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:39,960
Go ahead.

14
00:00:41,090 --> 00:00:42,300
I'm sorry.

15
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,400
[Seoul/Incheon to Los Angeles]

16
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:02,160
These are useless now.

17
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:09,800
[Hongseok]

18
00:01:10,650 --> 00:01:12,750
[Park Seonghyeon]

19
00:01:15,650 --> 00:01:17,650
[Shin Yongseok] [Shin Junseop] [Ha Yosep]

20
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:28,250
[Play Me]

21
00:01:46,070 --> 00:01:46,990
Yihyun!

22
00:01:58,750 --> 00:01:59,460
I'm sorry.

23
00:02:00,630 --> 00:02:01,960
Sorry for avoiding you.

24
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:07,130
I was afraid I'd make you lose everything.

25
00:02:16,180 --> 00:02:17,020
Yihyun.

26
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:20,190
I love you.

27
00:02:21,690 --> 00:02:24,150
I want to stay with you
for the rest of my life.

28
00:02:34,410 --> 00:02:35,579
Oh, right.

29
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:39,290
During the casting audition,

30
00:02:39,290 --> 00:02:41,370
how'd you recognize me?

31
00:02:49,090 --> 00:02:50,880
Jung Yihyun?

32
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:54,430
A-Are you okay?

33
00:02:56,810 --> 00:02:58,980
I missed you so much.

34
00:02:58,980 --> 00:03:01,560
Before, I saw you once
at the little theater.

35
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:04,480
I was the part-time painter.

36
00:03:05,190 --> 00:03:06,650
It was you?

37
00:03:14,030 --> 00:03:16,329
So that wasn't a dream?

38
00:03:16,329 --> 00:03:18,870
I didn't expect to
meet you again like this.

39
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:20,910
It's magical, isn't it?

40
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:24,420
Tell me about it.

41
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,920
Who would've thought
we'd do a musical together?

42
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:31,300
By the way, why did you
suddenly start doing musicals?

43
00:03:32,050 --> 00:03:34,390
It's been my dream for years.

44
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:37,970
I only worked as an actor
because of my mom.

45
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:40,890
My dream was always to be a director.

46
00:03:45,810 --> 00:03:48,570
My long-held dream has finally come true.

47
00:03:51,030 --> 00:03:53,820
So why's my panic disorder getting worse?

48
00:03:56,070 --> 00:03:58,620
And why's my heart in so much pain?

49
00:04:00,750 --> 00:04:02,460
Is it really like my mom said,

50
00:04:04,620 --> 00:04:07,250
that I'm nothing if I'm not an actor?

51
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,170
Yihyun.

52
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,130
Whether you're an actor

53
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,970
or a director,

54
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:19,160
no matter who you are,
I'll always love you.

55
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:32,890
[Musical: The Mermaid Prince]

56
00:04:33,570 --> 00:04:34,700
Hello.

57
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:36,280
Ticket, please.

58
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,409
-Enjoy the show.
-Thank you.

59
00:04:38,409 --> 00:04:39,530
Hello.

60
00:04:39,830 --> 00:04:41,040
Two people?

61
00:04:41,409 --> 00:04:42,870
Would you like a pamphlet?

62
00:04:45,250 --> 00:04:47,540
You can sit over there. Enjoy the show.

63
00:04:55,220 --> 00:04:56,300
Are you nervous?

64
00:04:56,300 --> 00:04:57,590
Yeah.

65
00:05:01,350 --> 00:05:04,430
Don't be nervous. You'll do great.

66
00:05:06,230 --> 00:05:07,100
I can do this.

67
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,310
I can do this.

68
00:05:10,230 --> 00:05:13,360
By the way, where's Kyungmin?

69
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,400
He's a bit late.

70
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:16,860
Right.

71
00:05:16,860 --> 00:05:19,120
Is he getting ready in the next room?

72
00:05:19,950 --> 00:05:21,530
We have a problem.

73
00:05:21,530 --> 00:05:23,750
Kyungmin got hurt. He's in the hospital.

74
00:05:23,750 --> 00:05:24,790
Huh?

75
00:05:25,250 --> 00:05:26,120
Is it severe?

76
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,540
Not really.

77
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:30,140
But he probably needs further tests.

78
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:33,840
I don't think he'll make it
before the show starts.

79
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:36,670
It's him. See you later.

80
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,180
Why don't we cancel today's show...

81
00:05:43,180 --> 00:05:44,560
How about you play Eden?

82
00:05:45,770 --> 00:05:47,690
We can't just cancel the premiere.

83
00:05:47,690 --> 00:05:49,690
You know all the lines and blocking.

84
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:51,230
You can do it.

85
00:05:55,690 --> 00:05:57,320
No.

86
00:05:59,070 --> 00:06:00,410
I can't act.

87
00:06:07,710 --> 00:06:08,710
I'm here.

88
00:06:09,670 --> 00:06:10,420
I really can't...

89
00:06:10,420 --> 00:06:11,480
Go on stage with me.

90
00:06:13,210 --> 00:06:14,170
You can do it.

91
00:06:30,810 --> 00:06:31,810
I'm sick of this.

92
00:06:33,190 --> 00:06:35,650
The same sea, the same routine.

93
00:06:36,780 --> 00:06:42,950
I'm sick of this sea.
Every day is the same.

94
00:06:42,950 --> 00:06:48,620
The waves are smiling,
but why am I stuck?

95
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:54,960
With every breath, my heart grows emptier,

96
00:06:56,460 --> 00:07:01,180
as I'm trapped in this unknown place.

97
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:08,470
It's as if something is calling me.

98
00:07:10,100 --> 00:07:15,400
That voice I thought I had long forgotten.

99
00:07:16,230 --> 00:07:20,530
Even though I know it's out of reach,

100
00:07:20,900 --> 00:07:22,410
once again,

101
00:07:23,780 --> 00:07:26,620
I gaze toward you.

102
00:07:59,940 --> 00:08:01,990
How is everyone doing?

103
00:08:03,820 --> 00:08:05,910
Today,

104
00:08:06,740 --> 00:08:09,200
I plan to go beyond that horizon.

105
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:18,710
I have a feeling
something interesting awaits me.

106
00:08:31,810 --> 00:08:36,100
Eden, do you really not remember anything?

107
00:08:36,100 --> 00:08:38,480
I don't think we've met before,

108
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:40,730
have we?

109
00:08:42,570 --> 00:08:44,320
You promised me.

110
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:47,950
When we meet again,
you'd go see the sea with me.

111
00:08:47,950 --> 00:08:50,150
I'm afraid you've got the wrong person.

112
00:08:50,870 --> 00:08:52,160
The wrong person?

113
00:08:53,290 --> 00:08:54,410
Then can you

114
00:08:55,370 --> 00:08:57,210
hug me

115
00:08:58,540 --> 00:09:00,000
for one last time?

116
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:14,680
Why did you just walk past me

117
00:09:15,270 --> 00:09:19,860
as if we don't have a past?

118
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:28,660
Even if our eyes meet,
you just drift away.

119
00:09:30,990 --> 00:09:35,540
Why do those looks I don't remember

120
00:09:36,500 --> 00:09:42,090
still linger in my heart?

121
00:09:42,090 --> 00:09:48,590
If this feeling is called love,

122
00:09:48,590 --> 00:09:52,390
why does it come to me
in such a heartbreaking manner?

123
00:09:52,390 --> 00:09:57,850
Don't talk about it in fleeting.

124
00:09:59,050 --> 00:10:04,280
My heart somehow always lingers with you.

125
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:11,410
I only ask you to look at me once.

126
00:10:11,410 --> 00:10:15,200
But one look might just shatter me.

127
00:10:29,630 --> 00:10:30,340
Luka.

128
00:10:33,140 --> 00:10:34,310
Open your eyes.

129
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:38,850
If the end of love is death,

130
00:10:40,690 --> 00:10:42,770
that'd be too unfair.

131
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:52,950
Why did I only recover my memory now?

132
00:10:53,570 --> 00:10:56,830
Why now,

133
00:10:56,830 --> 00:10:59,660
at this moment?

134
00:11:00,710 --> 00:11:05,540
I finally remembered your name,

135
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:11,380
but I could never call you again.

136
00:11:23,310 --> 00:11:25,770
I fell in love
the moment I laid eyes on you.

137
00:11:30,540 --> 00:11:33,280
[Eden: You saved me before.
Now it's my turn to save you.]

138
00:11:31,150 --> 00:11:33,280
In front of everyone,

139
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:35,120
I want to confess to you.

140
00:11:38,740 --> 00:11:40,910
I'll never let go of your hand.

141
00:11:42,580 --> 00:11:44,210
I love you.

142
00:12:09,940 --> 00:12:10,690
Go on.

143
00:12:11,070 --> 00:12:12,320
Accept it.

144
00:12:14,780 --> 00:12:16,450
You guys must've worried a lot about me.

145
00:12:16,450 --> 00:12:17,280
Get well soon!

146
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,490
Argh!

147
00:12:19,030 --> 00:12:19,830
Sorry.

148
00:12:19,830 --> 00:12:22,040
You've to get well soon
and return to the stage!

149
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:23,410
I'm fine.

150
00:12:23,410 --> 00:12:24,540
Don't worry.

151
00:12:24,540 --> 00:12:26,540
We've concluded this show run.

152
00:12:26,540 --> 00:12:28,800
How about dinner together to celebrate?

153
00:12:30,630 --> 00:12:33,500
Uh, I think I'm developing a fatty liver.

154
00:12:33,500 --> 00:12:34,800
My stomach doesn't feel good.

155
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:35,840
That's

156
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,930
your heart.

157
00:12:37,930 --> 00:12:40,220
It's my sister's birthday.

158
00:12:40,220 --> 00:12:42,310
I agreed to eat with my family.

159
00:12:43,180 --> 00:12:45,560
I'll get going!

160
00:12:46,730 --> 00:12:48,560
Me too. My stomach hurts.

161
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:49,650
I'll head out.

162
00:12:49,650 --> 00:12:50,980
Well done with the show.

163
00:12:53,740 --> 00:12:55,940
Didn't Kyungmin say he's an only child?

164
00:12:56,110 --> 00:12:57,360
Yeah.

165
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:59,530
Seho's so bad at lying.

166
00:13:00,530 --> 00:13:01,790
Those two...

167
00:13:02,540 --> 00:13:04,750
Love is in the air. 100%.

168
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:19,600
We'll probably get very busy
once the national tour starts.

169
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:21,870
Yeah.

170
00:13:21,870 --> 00:13:24,140
It'll be a whirlwind
for at least half a year.

171
00:13:24,140 --> 00:13:27,520
Still... I'm excited.

172
00:13:28,940 --> 00:13:32,020
After all, I'll be with you.

173
00:13:51,210 --> 00:13:51,940
This is nice.

174
00:13:56,130 --> 00:13:58,800
Ah! This is nice!

175
00:14:04,390 --> 00:14:06,230
This time,

176
00:14:06,890 --> 00:14:09,270
I won't let you go.

177
00:14:27,870 --> 00:14:29,830
Is this not the right move?

178
00:14:37,130 --> 00:14:37,970
I love you.

179
00:14:38,340 --> 00:14:40,010
I love you more.
